$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("[[Duration: ~12 min | Difficulty: Medium]] The mining mover Kestrel stopped answering six hours ago inside the Hollow Rock field. Her beacon is still pinging. Red flight goes in to find her and bring her crew home, and Theseus suspects the Cylons are using the rocks to hide.", -1)
$end_multi_text

